FR-009 on hardware, 2026-10-29. The board had been updated over the air to bundle 1c7e147, which
contains the pre-install handler (T048): the bundle was installed into slot A while B ran, and the
board rebooted into A. Before that, the running slot B (40a54ec) had no handler in its system.conf,
which is the expected state and not a reason to reflash. Console capture by the user.

EXCERPT. Omitted, nothing else edited: the repeated "NN% Copying image to rootfs.1" progress lines,
and the first screen of `cat /etc/rauc/system.conf`, which scrolled and is partly garbled in the
capture; its [handlers] section reads as below.

